    ],
    "text": "For Session 3, this paper proposed to simulate the performance of the enterprise port lo- gistics D&A system by developing a stochastic Petri net (SPN) model that is isomorphic to the meta-network. The average delay time of in-port transportation equipment of the illustra- tive enterprise was simulated using the SPN model and optimized based on the standard D&A system meta-network. According to the simulation results, the average detention time of trans- portation equipment was reduced from 140.17 minutes to 85.98 minutes, with a 38.7% reduc- tion."
  },
